OL,3,GNEWSABoy who downloaded TikTok terror
OL,4,Avideo spared jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager from Nottinghamshire who
OL,7,Fdownloaded a TikTok video on preparing
OL,8,Fexplosives and daubed racist graffiti
OL,9,Fon a woman's fence has been spared
OL,10,Fjail.
OL,12,FThe 14-year-old boy, who cannot be
OL,13,Fnamed because of his age, was given a
OL,14,Fthree-year youth rehabilitation order
OL,15,Fat Nottingham Justice Centre on Friday.
OL,17,FJudge Paul Goldspring told him: "I'm
OL,18,Fplacing some trust in you - please
OL,19,Frepay it by staying out of trouble and
OL,20,Fdoing as you are asked."
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
