OL,3,GNEWSABoy who downloaded TikTok terror
OL,4,Avideo spared jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had pleaded guilty in July to
OL,7,Frecording information useful to persons
OL,8,Fengaged in terrorism, racially or
OL,9,Freligiously aggravated criminal damage,
OL,10,Fand possessing an offensive weapon,
OL,11,Fafter a knuckle duster was found at his
OL,12,Fmother's home.
